{"1373530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Militsioner", "steam_appid": 1373530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/1e9d0c793772117838c450787da9c196.poster.avif?t=1787921468\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/1e9d0c793772117838c450787da9c196.webm?t=1787921468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/1e9d0c793772117838c450787da9c196.mp4?t=1787921468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're an ordinary nobody, who has never done anything noteworthy, let alone... a crime. It must be a mistake, – yet this morning you were arrested. Pack your stuff and leave as fast as possible, but be wary – every move you make is being followed by a Giant Policeman. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE &amp; PLAN </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>— While exploring potential ways to get to the train station, you see the ticket gate. </i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And in a true immersive sim manner, there always are a few options to solve every problem that you face.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANIPULATE RELATIONSHIPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>— Try to give a gift to the cashier, and she might give you a ticket for free. </i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The revitalizing immersive sim formula forces you to manage various characters moods. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/10ec95c71855422685a79d1719215238.poster.avif?t=1787921468\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/10ec95c71855422685a79d1719215238.webm?t=1787921468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/10ec95c71855422685a79d1719215238.mp4?t=1787921468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OR BREAK THE LAW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>— If you want to keep a gift as a backup in case things go south – just break the ticket gate, or sneak into the cashier’s booth at night to steal a ticket.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IF YOU GET CAUGHT, TAKE YOUR CHANCES AT ESCAPING FROM THE GIANT’S HAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>— While breaking into the cashier's booth you made too much noise and woke up the Giant. Now you must run for your life and seek shelter. </i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPEAT UNTIL YOU FIND YOUR WAY OUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>— Sell off any found or stolen goods to give yourself an edge moving forward.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAME IS BUILT TO BE REACTIVE, TRY EVERYTHING OUT AND SEE WHAT HAPPENS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character in the game, including the lawbringer, has a tamagochi-like mood system. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue system. The reactive system has free phrase selection. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theft. You can steal items from the streets, rob apartments, and shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth. The Town is constantly watching. If you get on their bad side, the police could get involved. But always remember, they hate you as much as they hate the Giant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time. Time is the key. Everyone, from cars and trains to people and Giants has their own life schedules. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/ce663a833d6b0c6865ee61d8ba57f47c.poster.avif?t=1787921468\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/ce663a833d6b0c6865ee61d8ba57f47c.webm?t=1787921468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/ce663a833d6b0c6865ee61d8ba57f47c.mp4?t=1787921468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/1e9d0c793772117838c450787da9c196.poster.avif?t=1787921468\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/1e9d0c793772117838c450787da9c196.webm?t=1787921468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/1e9d0c793772117838c450787da9c196.mp4?t=1787921468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're an ordinary nobody, who has never done anything noteworthy, let alone... a crime. It must be a mistake, – yet this morning you were arrested. Pack your stuff and leave as fast as possible, but be wary – every move you make is being followed by a Giant Policeman. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE &amp; PLAN </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>— While exploring potential ways to get to the train station, you see the ticket gate. </i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And in a true immersive sim manner, there always are a few options to solve every problem that you face.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANIPULATE RELATIONSHIPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>— Try to give a gift to the cashier, and she might give you a ticket for free. </i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The revitalizing immersive sim formula forces you to manage various characters moods. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/10ec95c71855422685a79d1719215238.poster.avif?t=1787921468\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/10ec95c71855422685a79d1719215238.webm?t=1787921468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/10ec95c71855422685a79d1719215238.mp4?t=1787921468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OR BREAK THE LAW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>— If you want to keep a gift as a backup in case things go south – just break the ticket gate, or sneak into the cashier’s booth at night to steal a ticket.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IF YOU GET CAUGHT, TAKE YOUR CHANCES AT ESCAPING FROM THE GIANT’S HAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>— While breaking into the cashier's booth you made too much noise and woke up the Giant. Now you must run for your life and seek shelter. </i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPEAT UNTIL YOU FIND YOUR WAY OUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>— Sell off any found or stolen goods to give yourself an edge moving forward.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAME IS BUILT TO BE REACTIVE, TRY EVERYTHING OUT AND SEE WHAT HAPPENS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character in the game, including the lawbringer, has a tamagochi-like mood system. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue system. The reactive system has free phrase selection. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theft. You can steal items from the streets, rob apartments, and shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth. The Town is constantly watching. If you get on their bad side, the police could get involved. But always remember, they hate you as much as they hate the Giant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time. Time is the key. Everyone, from cars and trains to people and Giants has their own life schedules. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/ce663a833d6b0c6865ee61d8ba57f47c.poster.avif?t=1787921468\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/ce663a833d6b0c6865ee61d8ba57f47c.webm?t=1787921468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/ce663a833d6b0c6865ee61d8ba57f47c.mp4?t=1787921468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Every move you make is being followed by a Colossal Policeman. Anger, flatter, disappoint, deceive or even romance him to escape in this kafkaesque immersive sim.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/ab9a2c7ad1f60db59a73b7938809248e764fd5ee/header